WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.040
Avengers...

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.020
"...assemble."

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.060
Fans can watch Earth's Mightiest Heroes aim
for the head, get rescued from space, learn

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.579
how to time travel, overcome all odds, and
bid final farewells to some of their crew

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.880
in a whole new way very soon.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:21.660
Marvel Entertainment has confirmed that Avengers:
Endgame is coming to the soon-to-debut streaming

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.480
platform Disney+.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:28.960
Fans who are keen to relive the epic highs,
crushing lows, and Cheez Whiz-filled middling

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.989
points of Joe and Anthony Russo's Infinity
Saga-closing epic can do so at the launch

00:00:33.989 --> 00:00:34.989
of Disney+.

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:39.829
That's right: there won't be any waiting around
to stream Avengers: Endgame for the 12th or

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:44.770
1,200th time - you can load up the flick on
Disney+ as soon as it goes live in the U.S.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.640
on Tuesday, November 12.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:51.900
Marvel fans in Canada and the Netherlands
can also stream Endgame that same day.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.540
Those in Australia and New Zealand will have
to wait a week for Disney+ to roll out, though

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:00.740
Endgame will be available to watch at launch
in their countries on Tuesday, November 19.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.320
Sucks for you guys, huh?

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.460
"I'm kidding!"

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.280
Though Marvel Entertainment mentioned only
those five countries when announcing Avengers:

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:12.790
Endgame's impending arrival on Disney+, it's
likely that the film will be an at-launch

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.840
title for the vast majority of - if not all
- territories.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:21.580
It seems a safe bet that whenever Disney+
launches, regardless of where in the world

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:25.740
you live, you can sit down for a lovely three-hour
Endgame watch session.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:30.700
Don't forget popcorn and candy to nervously
munch on when tensions run high, and a box

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.180
of tissues to turn to when Endgame hits its
many emotional beats.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:40.480
Touted as the go-to place for, quote, "never-before-seen
new movies, TV shows, documentaries, and more

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:45.020
from the world's greatest storytellers" with
"endless entertainment" and "streaming for

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:50.420
everyone," Disney+ is bound to become a massive
contender in the ongoing streaming wars.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:54.860
What's helping position the streamer as such
isn't just that it's owned by Disney and will

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:59.390
feature hundreds upon hundreds of beloved
movies and TV shows when it arrives - it's

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:04.320
also because Disney+ will be the exclusive
streaming home for a number of new original

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.500
Marvel series.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:10.619
The first Marvel superhero series headed to
Disney+ is The Falcon and the Winter Soldier,

00:02:10.619 --> 00:02:15.650
a team-up show starring Marvel Cinematic Universe
favorites Anthony Mackie and Sebastian Stan

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:20.409
as their respective characters Sam Wilson
- a.k.a. Falcon - and Bucky Barnes, a.k.a.

00:02:20.409 --> 00:02:21.860
the Winter Soldier.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:26.900
Also featuring Daniel Brühl as the infamous
Captain America: Civil War villain Helmut

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:29.610
Zemo , Emily VanCamp as ex-S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:35.430
agent Sharon Carter, and Wyatt Russell as
John Walker, a.k.a. U.S. Agent, The Falcon

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:40.320
and the Winter Soldier is slated to premiere
on Disney+ sometime in the fall of 2020.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:46.860
In early 2021, WandaVision, starring Elizabeth
Olsen's Scarlet Witch and Paul Bettany's Vision,

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:52.760
and Loki, the mini-series all about Tom Hiddleston's
titular trickster god, will arrive on Disney+.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:57.840
WandaVision, which will also feature Teyonah
Parris as Monica Rambeau, has been described

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:02.360
as a weird series that's unlike anything Marvel
has done before - while Loki is being talked

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:07.030
about as a time-hopping collection of adventures
that sees Thor's adopted brother influencing

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.830
huge events in human history.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:14.049
That same year, fans will feast their eyes
upon the animated Marvel series What If...?

00:03:14.049 --> 00:03:17.160
which features a voice cast filled with MCU
mainstays.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:22.260
They'll also get to dig into Hawkeye, which
sees Jeremy Renner's hero training a new vigilante

00:03:22.269 --> 00:03:24.060
to take on the Hawkeye mantle.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.340
But that's not all.

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:30.980
Marvel Studios, which oversees all Disney+
Marvel shows, has three more superhero series

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.780
in development set to debut on the streaming
service.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:39.959
There's Ms. Marvel, centered around the Pakistani
American hero Kamala Khan; Moon Knight, focused

00:03:39.959 --> 00:03:45.800
on the shadowy vigilante otherwise known as
Marc Spector; and She-Hulk, the series dedicated

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:50.660
to Bruce Banner's big, green, not-quite-as-mean
cousin Jennifer Walters.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:55.879
Those three series don't have release dates
just yet, but Marvel Entertainment Chief Creative

00:03:55.879 --> 00:04:00.549
Officer Kevin Feige has said that each and
every one of the Marvel-Disney+ series are

00:04:00.549 --> 00:04:05.120
extremely important to watch if you plan to
keep up with the film side of the MCU.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:10.239
He told Bloomberg in November 2019 that fans
will probably need a Disney+ subscription

00:04:10.239 --> 00:04:14.799
to, quote, "understand everything in future
Marvel movies," as events that take place

00:04:14.799 --> 00:04:20.420
on the upcoming series will connect to films
yet to come in Phase 4 - like Doctor Strange

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:24.940
in the Multiverse of Madness, which is set
to feature Scarlet Witch as a prominent player

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.820
and will apparently tie into the Loki series
as well.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:32.790
So, while Avengers: Endgame may be the current
top dog in the MCU, it's far from the only

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.920
exciting Marvel property that will call Disney+
its new streaming home.

